WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:09.300
I didn't build this to make courses. I built it because I got
tired of watching sharp people stay stuck.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:18.400
Everyone teaches the syntax. Almost nobody teaches judgment —
the thing that actually makes a senior.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:27.800
So every lesson ends in a proof — a check a skeptic can run.
Not a certificate. Evidence.

00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:38.100
It's the same loop I run every day: frame, map, decide, prove, ship.
Real production systems, solo — what holds up at 3am.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.800
Try a lesson. Free. No signup. If it clicks, I'll see you inside.
